refuel is a program for Turtles. Refuel will consume items from the inventory as fuel for turtle.

Any item a furnace would burn works, and items that store energy work too: a charged
battery from IC2 or an RF energy cell is drained rather than consumed, so it stays in the
inventory with less charge.

From Lua, turtle.refuel( 0 ) reports whether the item in the selected slot can be used as
fuel at all, without consuming or draining it.

ex:
"refuel" will refuel with at most one fuel item
"refuel 10" will refuel with at most 10 fuel items
"refuel all" will refuel with as many fuel items as possible
